{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Model / tool failures — agreed\n\nD-057 · Accepted from P-015.\nKnown no execution differs from unknown effects.\nNever repeat a possible completed action blindly.\n\n[[Model & Tool Failures]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "response",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Model response arrives\n\nValidate complete structured response/call data.\nVisible prose alone cannot execute a tool.\nDo not invent missing call IDs or arguments.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "invalid_reply",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Empty / incomplete reply\n\nShow a harness error or interrupted status.\nExecute no incomplete tool calls.\nKeep valid partial text and offer Continue.\nNo extra automatic regeneration loop.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "validate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Validate proposed action\n\nCheck tool, arguments, call ID and scope.\nApply required authorization.\nA denied action cannot be retried through another tool to evade the decision.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "correction",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Invalid proposal: no action ran\n\nReturn a linked tool error.\nAllow one corrected technical proposal.\nRepeated invalid request → report incomplete work.\nNo guessed arguments or new permissions.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Execute permitted action\n\nRecord actual execution/outcome.\nTimeout/cancellation alone does not prove no effect.\nKeep remaining work from compounding uncertainty.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconcile",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Determine actual outcome\n\nRead operation/undo records, files or available service status.\nKnown success, no effect, partial effect, or still unknown?\nDo not ask the model to guess.",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "success",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Verified success\n\nRecord/return what actually happened.\nDo not perform the action again to recreate a lost response.\nContinue the normal model/tool loop.",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Verified no / partial effect\n\nReturn the actual failure/changes.\nA corrected action retains normal permissions and recovery limits.\nNever silently undo unrelated successful edits.",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Still unknown: needs attention\n\nShow the uncertainty.\nDo not automatically repeat the action.\nKeep recovery data and block affected repository writes.\nRead-only inspection can help resolve it.",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "continue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Continue after ordinary failure\n\nNew run, context and undo boundary.\nUse actual completed/reverted outcomes.\nUnresolved repository recovery must be resolved before more editing.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle - Model Request Failures.canvas]]",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "records",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Keep necessary recovery data\n\nRetain full records while unresolved.\nAfter durable resolution, release unneeded undo snapshots.\nKeep normal chat/tool/diff history.\nDeleting a chat cannot erase unresolved recovery.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundaries",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Preserve the agreed distinction\n\nOrdinary failures retain successful edits.\nUser Stop / application crash restore tracked interrupted-run changes.\nSteering preserves the same undo boundary.\n\n[[Unexpected Closure Recovery]]",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "old_undo",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## First-version deferral — agreed\n\nNo dedicated Undo-an-earlier-run interface.\nLive Stop/crash restoration remains.\nNo whole-run time/step/tool budgets are added.\n\n[[Model & Tool Failures]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
